{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#card-zh","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 是一款面向 DSH 网页编辑器的提示词润色插件，在对话输入框旁加入按钮，调用当前会话正在使用的模型改写草稿。它提供平衡、精简、详细和代码导向四种风格，可结合最近对话理解上下文，并通过事实保留检查避免遗漏数字、路径等信息。润色成功后可一键恢复原文，适合希望快速把想法整理成清晰任务指令的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH 的 llm 与 webServer 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:480-587","src/client.js:382-465"]}
{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#card-en","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Prompt Polish adds a DSH composer button that rewrites drafts with the conversation model. Choose four styles; recent context and a fact check guide rewrites. Restore the original with one click. Requires DSH llm and webServer services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:480-587","src/client.js:382-465"]}
