{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#feature-1","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 的功能「风格选择」：点击按钮可按选定风格润色草稿；右键或键盘上下文菜单可切换平衡、精简、详细和代码导向风格，偏好保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:160-190"]}
{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#feature-2","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 的功能「结合会话上下文」：触发润色时插件读取当前会话最近的用户与助手消息，作为理解代词和上下文的辅助信息，并限制读取的消息数与文本长度。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:214-258"]}
{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#feature-3","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 的功能「保留关键信息」：模型改写后会检查数字、路径、URL、引用文本和代码标识符等具体信息；检查未通过时只进行一次带纠正提示的重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:364-392"]}
{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#feature-4","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 的功能「恢复原始草稿」：改写成功后按钮切换为恢复操作，用户可一键还原原始文本；请求处理中可取消，草稿或会话变化时会丢弃过期结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:288-350"]}
{"unit_id":"CTX666666__dsh-prompt-polish#caveat-1","repo":"CTX666666/dsh-prompt-polish","commit":"e038d16ee7cb4ad23cb2fe889bdc5d6a4a6cb46f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Polish 会将草稿及最近会话上下文通过 DSH 已配置的 llm 服务发送给所选模型；风格偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage 中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:485-493","src/client.js:176-185"]}
